### ==========================================
### 5. RESERVATION - TEMPORAL VALIDATION
### ==========================================

### endTime BEFORE startTime
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAuth.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "date": "2026-08-20",
  "startTime": "2026-08-20T15:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-08-20T14:00:00.000Z",
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "customerId": "{{createResCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "courtId": "{{createResCourt.response.body.id}}"
}


### endTime EQUAL startTime
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAuth.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "date": "2026-08-20",
  "startTime": "2026-08-20T14:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-08-20T14:00:00.000Z",
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "customerId": "{{createResCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "courtId": "{{createResCourt.response.body.id}}"
}


