### ==========================================
### MASTER DB - TENANTS CRUD (MASTER-SCOPED)
### ==========================================

### 1. Create Tenant (Onboarding)
# @name createNewTenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Club de Tenis Master",
  "slug": "club-tenis-master-01"
}

### 2. List All Tenants (Paginación por defecto)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Filter Tenants by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants?status=ACTIVE

### 4. Filter Tenants by Name (Búsqueda parcial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants?name=Tenis

### 5. Sort Tenants by Slug descendente
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants?sortBy=slug&order=desc

### 6. Get Tenant By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{createNewTenant.response.body.id}}

### 7. Update Tenant Status (Desactivar cliente)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{createNewTenant.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 8. Verify Tenant was Deactivated
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{createNewTenant.response.body.id}}




